# Found comparing with Spoom and sorbet-deadcode on discourse: a concern's
# `ClassMethods`, written as a module or made by `class_methods do`, is
# extended onto each includer by ActiveSupport::Concern, which finds it by
# its name, here with ActiveSupport not indexed. It is reached as surely as
# its concern is, so it is no candidate; its methods still are. A module
# nothing names is a candidate.
dead app/models Sluggable::ClassMethods=none Taggable::ClassMethods=none Widget::Helpers=unreferenced~ Sluggable::ClassMethods#find_by_slug=single-caller Taggable::ClassMethods#tagged=single-caller
